        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-HPULL48-622, Matte Black Ladder Door Pull with 26 Inch C.C.</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of stainless steel tubing with a matte black powder-coat, the 4 Foot Ladder Door Pull has a 26 Inch C.C. It is available with mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, back-to-back mounted, or surface mounted. The 48 Inch Matte Black Ladder Pull has a modern design that lends itself well to almost any setting--be it in the home or in a commercial setting like a storefront door or office.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-HPULL48-Specifications.gif?v=1704354580\" width=\"493\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-HPULL48-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/matte-black-24-inch-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull24-622\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/matte-black-36-inch-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull36-622\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/60-inch-black-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull60-622\"><b>60\" Black Door Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD HPULL48-622 4 Foot Matte Black Ladder Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 48\" (1220 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 26\" (660 mm) </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "48 Inch Matte Black Ladder Pull, DWD-HPULL48-622",
                "description": "DWD-HPULL48-622, 48 Inch Matte Black Ladder Pull - Made out of stainless steel tubing with a matte black powder-coat, the 4 Foot Ladder Door Pull has a 26 Inch C.C. It is available with mounting kits for use on wood, metal, or glass doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, back-to-back mounted, or surface mounted. The 48 Inch Matte Black Ladder Pull has a modern design that lends itself well to almost any setting--be it in the home or in a commercial setting like a storefront door or office.\r\n",
